            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. Physical and Occupational Therapists who are assigned to an irregular schedule that requires a teacher to regularly work forty (40) hours per week exclusive of meal breaks shall be paid at the base rate of 1.15 times their regular teaching salary.",
